  "requirement": "The SDK offers this `Sources` method. Its source tools expose the\n`search_text` command.\n\n```rust,ignore\nimpl Sources {\n    // ...\n\n    /// Search available project files.\n    pub async fn search_text(&self, query: &TextQuery) -> Result<TextMatches, SourceError>;\n\n    // ...\n}\n```",
